Description: Creates, edits, and samples sparse volumetric grids using
    'OpenVDB' <https://www.openvdb.org/>. Supports signed distance fields,
    constructive solid geometry, conversion between triangle meshes and
    volumes, file exchange, and a native runtime interface.
